   317	| EXP-000 | shared | loop harness: `lab/bin` engine up/down, slots, gate runner, receipts, scorecard; runner admission replaced; qualification test breakage fixed | none |
   318	| EXP-001 | X1 | baseline: G0, G1, G2 on our XTDB with XTQL and SQL tallies; first scale probe at 10k | EXP-000 |
   319	| EXP-002 | Q1 | baseline: G0, G1, G2 on our QLever; first scale probe at 10k | EXP-000 |
   320	| EXP-003 | shared | repository types and descriptors in a core subpath; projection spec compiler with collision checks | none |
   321	| EXP-004 | X2 | task-wide fixed cut via snapshot tokens, and XTQL parity wave A (non-recursive tasks) | EXP-001 |
