lab/research/R1-xtdb-capabilities.md:61:- `TxResolver.kt:215-229`. An explicit time that is equal to or earlier than the latest completed tx aborts with `invalid-system-time` / "specified system-time must be later than current tx". The comment cites issue #6086 (equal times make a read basis ambiguous).
lab/research/R1-xtdb-capabilities.md:63:- `TxResolver.kt:235-246`. The effective system time also becomes the tx's `currentTime`, which is the default `_valid_from` and `CURRENT_TIMESTAMP`.
