lab/research/R6-xtdb-gap-analysis.md:403:- **Proven (inherited).** `NOT EXISTS` tasks 09, 12, 13 and the watermark-based absence task 10 pass in SQL on the fixed fixtures. Single-call paging at a returned basis (native-entry l.328-373).
