lab/research/R6-xtdb-gap-analysis.md:410:- **Missing.** XTQL `aggregate`. Overflow (Goal 2). Typed group identity beyond string keys. Set versus pair versus witness distinctions only on the four-node DAG. No aggregate at scale.
