lab/research/R6-xtdb-gap-analysis.md:423:- **Proven (inherited, shared).** Safe and unsafe CAS rejection (`P0004`) with rollback, claims, receipts (handoff review). Tiny v4: seven ACKs, five claims, seven operation receipts, Required rejection with no residue, two ConfigStore releases.
