lab/research/R6-xtdb-gap-analysis.md:436:- **Proven (inherited).** Tiny v4 passes membership, lineage, history, corrections, presence/type-version facts, receipts on ordinary reads (47/52). Native: fractional-V half-open boundaries in XTQL, retirement masking in SQL, interval union (18), lineage (16), per-example two-time join (19).
lab/research/R6-xtdb-gap-analysis.md:437:- **Missing.** The five target failures (3.1). XTQL retirement masking. Native reads of the configured fixture. Deletion and cascades (presence=false is an application convention with no cascade; `presence-reference-deletion-requirements-v1`). Same-timestamp distinct commits through native.
lab/research/R6-xtdb-gap-analysis.md:438:  A mapping from R or P to system time (3.4).
