lab/research/R4-codebase-harness-map.md:93:### 2.1 The interface each backend implements
lab/research/R4-codebase-harness-map.md:100:| `validateConstraints?` | `:25-29` | Optional server-side `Constraint.newlyViolated`. XTDB implements it for `inline`/`projection` strategies; QLever does not. |
lab/research/R4-codebase-harness-map.md:104:| `dependencyState(attributes, basis)` | `:39-42` | `{sourcePosition, nextTemporalBoundary?}` for projection freshness. |
