lab/research/R4-codebase-harness-map.md:238:| Mixed numeric columns | Safe JS integers go as `int8` (OID 20), other numbers as `float8` (OID 701). XTDB is dynamically typed, so `value_number`, `recorded_at`, `valid_from` etc. can hold a union of i64 and f64. Decode uses `Number(...)` and rejects non-finite (`nullableNumber`). | `XtdbClient.ts:148-161`; `codecs.ts:116-122` |
lab/research/R4-codebase-harness-map.md:241:| json | `value_json` = `JSON.stringify(value)` (retains key order); the canonical sorted form goes only to `value_identity` and constraint identity. | `codecs.ts:98-101` |
