lab/research/R2-qlever-capabilities.md:384:### 6.2 `--no-patterns`
lab/research/R2-qlever-capabilities.md:386:- **What it turns off:** the precomputed pattern file used for `ql:has-predicate` and the "pattern trick" (fast `?s ?p ?o` predicate counting). With it, `ql:has-predicate` fails: HTTP 500 `Assertion usePatterns_ failed... (do not specify the --no-patterns option for this to work)`. [P][S] `src/index/IndexBuilderMain.cpp:265-266 @ 6c5861a`, `src/index/IndexImpl.cpp:1176 @ 6c5861a`.
