lab/research/R2-qlever-capabilities.md:404:Useful runtime parameters (global, set with an access token or at start) [S] `src/global/RuntimeParameters.h:48-205 @ 6c5861a`: `query-planning-budget` (1500), `sort-in-memory-threshold` (5 GB; the external `Sort` operator spills to `<base>.sort.<uuid>.dat` above it, see `src/engine/Sort.cpp:83-105,168-190 @ 6c5861a`, but `ORDER BY` itself sorts in memory, `src/engine/OrderBy.cpp:66-122`), `request-body-limit` (1 GB), `cache-max-num-entries` (1000), `lazy-index-scan-num-threads` (2), `parallel-sort-num-threads` (3).
