    72	   |           x6 permutations: locate block, add, consolidate DeltaTriples.cpp:200-225
    73	   |     updateAugmentedMetadata()          O(delta)           DeltaTriples.cpp:546-552
    74	   |     writeToDisk()                      O(delta) full rewrite of <base>.update-triples
    75	   |     snapshot = deep copy of all located triples  O(delta) DeltaTriples.cpp:483-492
    76	   |     publish snapshot  (queries started afterwards see it)
    77	   v
    78	cache().clearAll()   every update empties the whole result cache   Server.cpp:1307-1308
    79	```
    80	
    81	All of it is under `@ 6c5861a`. If any op throws, control leaves `modify` before `writeToDisk` and the snapshot swap, but the mutable delta keeps what already ran (see 1.8).
