   791	
   792	| API | Engine-neutral first implementation | Native pushdown later |
   793	|-----|-------------------------------------|------------------------|
   794	| `get`, `getMany` | `Triples.entity`, `Triples.entities` (batched, order and missing entries preserved), membership check on `entityType` like `EntityStore` | none needed |
