    85	| Native query contract types | Caller-supplied | `NativeQueryContract {name, parameters: TypeExpr, row: TypeExpr}` (`packages/core/src/native/NativeQuery.ts:14-19`). `hydrateNativeValue` (`:98-156`) uses the declared `row` type to turn strings and bigints into exact `int64`. |
    86	
    87	Design implication for thesis T1 (table-per-type projection): the writer needs the `EntityType` set at transaction time. The cheapest source is the in-process `EntityType` objects passed to the adapter factory, with the committed release checked against them by `cid` at startup.
