   216	### 3.1 The five failing "historical retirement-metadata" checks (configured-entity tiny v4)
   217	
   218	**Fixture.** Eight configured subjects in one fresh scope, public ConfigStore schema v1 then v2, sparse seed (24 facts), dense expansion (96 facts),
