   390	  Triplex requires rejection. Native errors surface as `ReadError("XTDB native query failed: PostgresError...")`; no mapping to a specified error taxonomy. Division, remainder, NaN, out-of-range cast through native.
   391	  XTQL expressions used in the library: `=`, `<=`, `>`, `and`, `or`, `not`, `nil?`, `if`, `coalesce`. DECIMAL aggregates fail in the engine (`integer-extrema` evidence).
