   395	
   396	- **Proven (inherited).** 14 of 71 tasks use server-side relation rounds with budgets of 100,000 rows and 100 rounds (`xtdb-workloads.ts:208-213`, `Reachability.ts:35-43`). Fake-client unit tests for lost-round-ACK reconciliation and row-guard failure (`packages/xtdb/test/native-reachability.test.ts`).
   397	- **Missing.** Any plan or cost capture (`EXPLAIN`, `explain-analyze?` exists at `scan.clj:313`). Admission is after the fact: `LIMIT maxRows+1` and an `ASSERT` row-count guard follow the `INSERT`.
